1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,955
So why did the two torches show no stripes?

2
00:00:02,955 --> 00:00:09,778
The stripes only stay still if the phase difference at each point stays the same from moment to moment.

3
00:00:09,778 --> 00:00:15,677
That needs coherent sources: same frequency, and a constant phase difference.

